oose one collection or exhibition to discuss afterward; the museum provides a calm cultural change of pace.","short_summary":"An academic museum with art, artifacts, and rotating exhibitions.","evidence_claim":"The University of Mississippi Museum and Historic Houses holds collections including Southern folk art, Greek and Roman antiquities, scientific instruments, and American fine art.","source_url":"https://olemiss.edu/museum/","source_title":"Museum and Historic Houses | Ole Miss","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Public museum hours are Tuesday–Friday 10 a.m.–5 p.m. and Saturday 10 a.m.–4 p.m.; it is closed Sunday and Monday.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rowan-oak-grounds","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Rowan Oak Grounds","title":"Walk the Rowan Oak grounds","subtitle":"William Faulkner's home • Saturday afternoon","notes":"Take a self-guided walk around the grounds and exterior, then decide whether the paid house interior fits your plans; keep the visit at an unhurried pace.","short_summary":"The free grounds around William Faulkner's historic home offer a literary landmark close to campus.","evidence_claim":"The grounds at Rowan Oak, William Faulkner's home, are open without charge from dawn to dusk daily.","source_url":"https://olemiss.edu/museum/visit/","source_title":"Visit the Museum | Ole Miss","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Grounds are open dawn to dusk daily. Interior house admission costs $5 and has separate hours.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"vaught-hemingway-stadium","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Vaught-Hemingway Stadium","title":"End with a home-game option","subtitle":"Game-day stop • Saturday","notes":"If there is a home football game, watch the Walk of Champions first and then head toward the stadium with your valid ticket and your group's meeting plan.","short_summary":"A conditional final stop for an official Ole Miss home-football weekend.","evidence_claim":"Ole Miss states that the football team walks through the Grove to Vaught-Hemingway Stadium before every home game.","source_url":"https://olemiss.edu/athletics/gamedays-in-the-grove/","source_title":"Gamedays in the Grove | Ole Miss","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Only use this stop on a home-game weekend; stadium entry requires the applicable event ticket and adherence to venue policies.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
